    The listens in one line, beside a voice: three people in a circle and a few words. For whoever listens (read.php,
    record.php) it only shows once the voice has filled a sofa, and without the number; for the staff (voices.php, the
    booklet), with it. The context comes from listens::context(); with small false, nothing is shown.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "small": "27 escuchas · una clase entera",
        "glyph": "<svg class=\"ayv-esc-glifo ayv-esc-glifo-on\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg>"
    }
}}
{{#small}}<span class="ayv-esc-chico">{{{glyph}}}<span>{{small}}</span></span>{{/small}}
